Say it in your own words. Shape: **context → your slice → productionisation (guardrails, observability, evals, reliability) → the thesis close.**

> "The project I'd pick is the generative-AI search platform at ANZ Plus. The platform let services surface answers from bank content using retrieval-augmented generation on Vertex AI and Gemini, and the defining constraint was the environment: regulated banking, where a wrong or non-compliant answer has real consequences, so productionisation wasn't a nice-to-have, it was the job.
