> My slice, specifically: I owned the search and retrieval APIs, the retrieval side of the RAG system, and I drove the team's AI integration strategy and guardrails. I won't claim the whole platform, but the piece I owned is the piece that determines answer quality, because if retrieval returns the wrong content no model downstream can save you.
